Track 1: Needle-Point Baptism
- Story & Context: Brother Silas accidentally dropped his sensory needle into the sacred baptismal fountain, causing a short-circuit that pulsed the entire monastery’s dream-synth array with the sound of freezing water. The monks stood in perfect stillness as the fountain began to rhythmically boil over with ink, humming a frequency that made their teeth ache. "The thread breaks to let the light through," whispered Silas, as the first loop of the new era began to spin.
